OL,3,AThousands affected and roads closed
OL,4,Aafter burst pipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company spokesperson said: "Our teams
OL,7,Fare on site and working as quickly and
OL,8,Fsafely as possible to repair the burst
OL,9,Fand restore supplies."
